OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy before
OL,4,Afleeing UK to be sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeaton Slater, 12, was killed in a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run as he walked home from
OL,8,Fschool in June 2024
OL,10,FDriver Aleksanders Dolars fled to
OL,11,FLatvia afterwards and was only
OL,12,Fextradited back to UK in August this
OL,13,Fyear
OL,15,FThe 23-year-old Latvian admitted
OL,16,Fcausing death by dangerous driving
OL,18,FWarwick Crown Court heard he had been
OL,19,Fdriving at 70mph on a 30mph road at the
OL,20,Ftime of Keaton's death
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
