OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy before
OL,4,Afleeing UK to be sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe did not want to attend his
OL,7,Fsentencing hearing, but the judge
OL,8,Fdemanded he be brought to court
OL,10,FHis name has been known publicly as
OL,11,FDolars Aleksanders, but the court has
OL,12,Fconfirmed Latvian officials say it is
OL,13,FAleksanders Dolars
